listening("a01", 4, "Before we finalize the launch schedule, I'd like to clarify one point. The prototype passed the laboratory tests, but we still need feedback from the pilot group using it in ordinary workplaces. A strong laboratory result does not guarantee that the instructions are clear to a first-time user. Please send your observations to Maya by Thursday, separating technical faults from difficulties understanding the guide. We will decide on the launch date after reviewing both categories.", [
 ("Why has the launch date not been finalized?", ["Feedback from workplace users is still needed.", "The prototype failed every laboratory test.", "The pilot group has withdrawn.", "Maya has already canceled the launch."], "Passed lab nhưng still need feedback từ người dùng thực tế trước khi chốt ngày."),
 ("What distinction should listeners make in their reports?", ["Technical problems versus unclear instructions", "Domestic versus international prices", "New versus old employees", "Paid versus unpaid leave"], "Separating technical faults from difficulties understanding the guide là yêu cầu phân loại."),
 ("What is implied about laboratory testing?", ["It may not reveal every difficulty experienced by users.", "It replaces the need for all user feedback.", "It was performed by first-time customers only.", "It determines the product's retail price."], "Kết quả phòng lab tốt không đảm bảo người mới hiểu hướng dẫn; cần bổ sung quan sát thực tế.")])
